      "expr": "01-smile",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cg",
      "action": "hide"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "關口下方有個飲料攤。風把旗布吹得啪啪響。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "suting"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "suting",
      "text": "凌晨，我渴了。到那邊買個菊花茶好嗎？",
      "expr": "01-smile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "suting"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "好。你在這兒等。菊花茶。",
      "expr": "02-blush"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "素婷轉頭向走在前頭的家綸喊了一聲——要不要黑加侖子。那黑加侖子遙呼好，錢稍後再給。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "他邊答應邊往攤檔走，身子不提防撞上別人。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "zhijun",
      "expr": "04-puff",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "怎麼走路不長眼睛的？",
      "expr": "04-puff"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "編馬尾的團友。第三天了，他仍不知道她的名字。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "對不起哩。",
      "expr": "04-cold"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "攤檔前翻開錢包——才七元八角。菊花茶買得了，六元的黑加侖子買不了。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "回頭找素婷討錢一定失威。他寧願硬著頭皮，問身邊這位團友。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "zhijun",
      "expr": "01-laugh",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "喂，怎麼了？",
      "expr": "01-laugh"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "呀，是這樣的……我本想幫朋友買汽水，卻不夠零錢在身。",
      "expr": "05-fire"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "請問你可不可以借個零錢給我？",
      "expr": "05-fire"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "當然可以呀。",
      "expr": "02-hips"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "她低頭翻出一張二十元，笑了笑，說遲些再還。然後轉身要走。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "等等！",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "問人家借了二十元，卻連名字也不知道——好歹是債主。她早已回過頭來，微笑著等他發言。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "jump",
      "to": "wall_mister"
    }
  ]
}
